// ============================================================
// Alert Logic Notes:
// - Threshold of 5 failures in 5 min is a starting baseline.
//   Tune based on your environment's normal login patterns.
// - Consider whitelisting known scanner IPs or service accounts.
// - Pair with a successful login check (Event ID 4624) on the
//   same IP to escalate priority (credential stuffing pattern).
// ============================================================
